{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2022-05-12 08:00:00', 'title': "LOWE'S COMMITS MORE THAN $15 MILLION TO SUPPORT NATIONAL NONPROFITS IN 2022", 'text': "COMMITMENTS TO MILITARY AND OTHER NONPROFITS TO INCLUDE MORE THAN $9 MILLION TO CREATE SAFE, AFFORDABLE HOUSING AND $4 MILLION TO SUPPORT SKILLED TRADES WITH GENERATION T PARTNERS MOORESVILLE, N.C., MAY 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LOWE'S TODAY ANNOUNCED A COMMITMENT OF MORE THAN $15 MILLION TO SUPPORT NATIONAL NONPROFIT PARTNERS IN 2022, ADDRESSING SOME OF THE MOST CRITICAL CHALLENGES FACING COMMUNITIES TODAY."}